---
title: Gateau aux Poire
course: Dessert
locale: en
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: French
---

Beat together the @sugar{150%g} and @eggs{3}, then add the @flour{100%g}, @vanilla essence{}, the @baking powder{2%tsp} and half the @milk{0.5%pint}.

Melt the @butter{50%g} in the other half of the milk and leave to cool.

Then mix in with the rest of the mixture and add the @rum{2%tbsp}.

Peel and slice the @pears{500%g} and place in a greased #baking dish{}. Pour the mixture over the top.

Bake in a moderate oven (180ºC) for about ~{40%minutes} or until cooked.